Third-party code bundled with this project:

- include/MaxsuWeaponParry/  -  from doodlum/MaxsuWeaponSwingParry-ng (GPL-3.0).
  WeaponParry_Functions.h/.cpp are unchanged apart from removing a FMT_STRING()
  wrapper around the log format strings.
- include/OAR/                -  Open Animation Replacer modder API from
  ersh1/OpenAnimationReplacer, copied verbatim (its headers are provided for
  exactly this purpose).
- include/PrecisionAPI.h      -  Precision modder API, copied verbatim.
- include/SmoothCamAPI.h      -  SmoothCam modder API, copied verbatim.
- extern/CommonLibSSE-NG/     -  alandtse/CommonLibSSE-NG v8.0.1 (GPL-3.0-or-later).
